<title>ITALY: Italy has global trade surplus in Nov.</title>
<headline>Italy has global trade surplus in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy had a 3.622 trillion lire global trade surplus in November, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p> ITALIAN TRADE BALANCE  Nov 96	  Oct 96	  Nov 95</p>
<p> Amount (lire)	   +3.622 trln    +5.500 trln   +1.502 trln</p>
<p> Cumulative yr to date +38.769 trln   +35.441 trln  +20.733 trln</p>
<p>Note: The calculation is based on flows through the financial sector on transactions in excess of 20 million lire.</p>
</text>
